    "chunk_text": "t folc on fleame gebrohte. \u00dea b\u00e6d his f\u00e6der, w\u00e6s eac Fauius haten, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea senatum forgeafen \u00fe\u00e6m suna \u00feone gylt, & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea bebead se f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6m consule \u00fe\u00e6t he mid his fierde angean fore, & he be\u00e6ftan gebad mid \u00dea he geseah \u00fe\u00e6t Pontius, Somnita cyning, h\u00e6fde \u00feone consul his sunu besired, & mid his folce \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Somnita XX M ofslagen, & IIII M gefangen mi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge. \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Romana gewinn & Somnita geendad, for \u00feon \u00fee hie heora cyning gefengon, \u00fe\u00e6tte hie \u00de\u00e6s on o\u00ferum geare Curius se consul mid Romanum gefeaht wi\u00f0 Sabinan, & heora ungemet \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s IIII hunde wintrum & LXIII \u00fea \u00f0a Dolabella & \u00dea sendon Romane \u00e6rendracan to Gallium ymbe fri\u00f0; \u00fea ofslogon hie \u00f0a \u00e6rendracan. \u00dea sendon hie eft Cecilium heora pretorium mid firde \u00fe\u00e6r Gallie & Bryti \u00e6tg\u00e6dere w\u00e6ron, & he Swa oft swa Galli wi\u00f0 Romanum wunnan, swa wurdon Romane gecnysede. For \u00feon ge Romane, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, \u00feonne ge ymb \u00fe\u00e6t an gefeoht alneg ceoria\u00f0 \u00fee eow Gotan Ic sceal eac gemyndgian be sumum d\u00e6le \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee Alexandres \u00e6fterfylgendas dydon on \u00fe\u00e6m tidum Hit is, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, \u00fe\u00e6m gelicost, \u00feonne ic his ge\u00feencean sceal, \u00fee ic sitte on anre heare dune, & Swa ofer eall M",
